sequenceDiagram
  User->>UI: Enter or speak a command
  UI->>Assistant: Command text
  Assistant->>IntentDB: Match intent and extract entities
  alt Local action
    Assistant->>Actions: Dispatch action
    Actions->>Persistence: Read or write notes and alarms
    Actions->>Scheduler: Schedule or cancel alarm
    Actions-->>Assistant: Result
  else General question with API key
    Assistant->>OpenAI: Responses API request
    OpenAI-->>Assistant: Answer
  end
  Assistant->>SpeechOut: Speak response when TTS is available
  Assistant-->>UI: Show response and structured results

  opt Calendar command
    Actions->>GoogleCalendar: OAuth-authorized read request
    GoogleCalendar-->>Actions: Upcoming events
  end
